{
  "_note": [
    "Reusable section shapes. These are the templates the section definitions in",
    "section-definitions.json were instantiated from, and their ids/versions match the",
    "sourceTemplateId/sourceTemplateVersion recorded there.",
    "",
    "Two are deliberately NOT in lockstep, so drift is demonstrable rather than uniformly clean:",
    "  - st_applicant v4 omits boardCertNumber, which sd_applicant added locally -> ADDED_LOCALLY",
    "  - st_licensure is v4 while sd_licensure records v3 and lacks licenseIssueDate",
    "    -> behindTemplate + ADDED_IN_TEMPLATE",
    "",
    "Repetition sits on st_licensure because a licence list is inherently repeating. It is",
    "absent from st_address on purpose: the same address template is placed twice in the real",
    "form, repeating for practice locations and not for the billing address, so repetition is a",
    "property of the placement rather than of the template."
  ],
